@page "/qcqa/iqc"
@attribute [Authorize(Policy = "QcRead")]
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> Loc

@*  Phase 6 Bước 3 — IQC stub (intentional).

    IQC (Incoming Quality Control) — quality check on incoming raw
    materials — does NOT share the QcInspection entity with IPQC/FQC/OQC
    because it ties to a raw-material batch (not a WorkOrder). The
    Phase 6 plan (docs/PHASE6-PLAN.md §3 Bước 7) ships IQC as its own
    entity + service + migration so the foreign-key + filter semantics
    match the workflow.

    This page deliberately keeps the placeholder chrome so operators see
    "in progress, not forgotten" rather than a broken grid. *@

<h1>@Loc["qcqa.iqc.title"]</h1>

<div class="npi-placeholder">
    <p class="muted">@Loc["qcqa.iqc.stub_lead"]</p>
    <ul>
        <li>@Loc["qcqa.iqc.stub_li1"]</li>
        <li>@Loc["qcqa.iqc.stub_li2"]</li>
        <li>@Loc["qcqa.iqc.stub_li3"]</li>
    </ul>
</div>
